OL,3,GNEWSALabour to ditch Greens on council
OL,4,Aover Zionism vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour has said it will end its
OL,7,Fcoalition deal and run Sheffield City
OL,8,FCouncil as a minority administration
OL,9,Fafter the national Green Party adopted
OL,10,Fa policy defining Zionism as a form of
OL,11,Fracism.
OL,13,FSheffield Labour said the city's Green
OL,14,FParty had "refused to distance itself"
OL,15,Ffrom the national policy, so it would
OL,16,Fgo it alone after Wednesday's full
OL,17,Fcouncil meeting.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
