OL,3,GNEWSALabour to ditch Greens on council
OL,4,Aover Zionism vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FNationally, Labour said it would end
OL,7,Fpower-sharing agreements with the
OL,8,FGreens on local councils, unless
OL,9,Fcouncillors disowned the party's
OL,10,Fnewly-adopted policy.
OL,12,FThe Greens called the decision "a
OL,13,Freally troubling attack on local
OL,14,Fdemocracy", and accused the group of
OL,15,Ftaking "top-down demands from London".
